    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc2d Work together in a team of 2-4 mice to haul that cheese back to the company!<br>One mistake, and your paycheck drops to zero.<br>Seriously, why did you even take this job?! It\u2019s the ultimate nightmare company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/a934f1c1d76913fa788e2eec9b7fe929.poster.avif?t=1746320577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/a934f1c1d76913fa788e2eec9b7fe929.webm?t=1746320577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/a934f1c1d76913fa788e2eec9b7fe929.mp4?t=1746320577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa4 Includes voice chat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet near the cat\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >one sneeze, and the whole company goes under\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/67d05ba2124c7ae6f3d6e0b9621d2024.poster.avif?t=1746320577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/67d05ba2124c7ae6f3d6e0b9621d2024.webm?t=1746320577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527940/extras/67d05ba2124c7ae6f3d6e0b9621d2024.mp4?t=1746320577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Packed with exciting gimmicks and surprises!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar